{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489019,"name":"Yael","username":"y123","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/bc79bd/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:01:48.634Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot lost connection to its Agent Computer immediately after one of my bots tried to set up a VPN \u003cem\u003eon that computer\u003c/em\u003e. Every bot on the account now fails to reconnect, including on phone. The main assistant no longer appears in the phone app roster.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI understand now that a VPN inside the Agent Computer is unsupported because it breaks the always-on path back to Cursor’s servers. I cannot ask a bot to uninstall the VPN, because no bot can reach the machine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBot on the shared Agent Computer started setting up a VPN / changing network settings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnection dropped right after that.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesktop and phone both show reconnect / “can’t reach Grok Bot’s computer.”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOther bots on the same account also cannot reach the computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMain bot is missing from the phone roster.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat I already tried\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry reconnect\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit / relaunch Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChecked from phone as well as desktop\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOS: \u003cstrong\u003eMacOS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVPN that caused this: installed \u003cstrong\u003einside the Agent Computer by the bot\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease repair or reattach the existing Agent Computer from the backend. Reinstall the VPN.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUninstall the VPN and restore default routing/DNS\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDelete any routine/script that installs a VPN\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd a standing rule: never install VPN/proxy or change DNS/network settings\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor / Grok Bot?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes — Grok Bot is unusable until the Agent Computer is reachable again.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T14:01:57.583Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":11,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":51.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171357,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect","display_username":"Yael","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137332,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect/171357/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":489021,"name":"Yael","username":"y123","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/bc79bd/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:02:47.053Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThe problem was fixed. Thank you\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T14:02:47.053Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171357,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect","display_username":"Yael","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137332,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect/171357/3","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489930,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T10:06:25.700Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, glad it’s working now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the future, to avoid this happening again: changing network settings inside the Agent Computer VPN, proxy, or DNS routing breaks the always-on connection to the servers. After that, no bot can reach the machine to roll the changes back. It’s worth adding a permanent rule for bots not to set up a VPN or proxy and not to change DNS or other network settings on the Agent Computer, and also removing any routine or script that does this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you run into “can’t reach your computer” again, post in the thread and we’ll take a look.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T10:06:25.700Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171357,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect/171357/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[489019,489021,489930]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,2],[3,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":408,"name":"networking","slug":"networking"},{"id":373,"name":"computer-use","slug":"computer-use"}],"tags_descriptio